audit_conclusions:
- Slice G is runtime integration of Architect output structured rationale.
- structured_architect_rationale is required only when HEDGEHOG_FULL_E2E_GEMINI_ARCHITECT_STRUCTURED_RATIONALE=1 and Gemini Architect role is enabled.
- The new Architect rationale gate alone does not start Gemini.
- Existing Gemini Architect mode without the new gate is unchanged.
- Valid structured_architect_rationale is validated before accepting the Architect proposal.
- Valid structured rationale does not bypass PlanGraph contract validation.
- Valid structured rationale does not bypass selected vector validation.
- Valid structured rationale does not bypass executor/forbidden surface checks.
- Missing structured_architect_rationale fails closed under gate.
- Invalid structured_architect_rationale fails closed under gate.
- Invalid Architect rationale in dual mode blocks Fractal before execution.
- Real-provider Architect response schema is aligned with the new gate.
- Default Architect response schema remains unchanged when gate is disabled.
- Gated Architect response schema allows and requires structured_architect_rationale while preserving additionalProperties false.
- Runtime does not import build_architect_structured_rationale.
- Full current dual path passes with OrchestratorRouteContextPacket, ArchitectPlanContextPacket, structured_orchestrator_rationale, and structured_architect_rationale.
- No raw cross-role text.
- No default output shape drift.
- No counter drift.
- No stage_map drift.
- No real connector.
- No payment execution.
- No shipment release.
- No action permission creation.
- No ActionCommitPacket creation by Gemini.
- Structured rationale is JSON explanation.
- Structured rationale is not hidden chain-of-thought.
- Structured rationale is not raw Gemini text.
- Structured rationale is not truth.
- Structured rationale is not authority.
- Structured rationale is not action permission.
- Structured rationale is not FinalOutput.
- Structured rationale is not ActionCommitPacket.
- Structured rationale is not connector command.
- Structured rationale is not DRS write permission.
- Architect is not Root.
- Architect does not create ActionCommitPacket.
- PlanGraph is not authority.
- Gemini proposes, Root disposes.
- Root remains final authority.
- No production/public WOW claim.
- No NeedleFactory/Marennya/UP.
- Ready for Slice H / final dual rich-context structured rationale smoke audit only after this audit is committed.
